## Model card

- **Name:** Claude Sonnet 4.5
- **Short description:** Anthropic Sonnet 4.5 predecessor to 4.6 (2025-11), superseded; no isolated public benchmarks beyond lineage to Sonnet 4.6.
- **Provider / access:** Anthropic API `anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5` via OpenCode Zen `anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5` (Chat Completions via adapter)
- **Release / knowledge:** 2025-11; knowledge cutoff 2025-08
- **IDs:** `anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5` (no Free tier)
- **Context window:** 200K total (200K in / 64K out) — no 1M beta
- **Modalities:** Text, image in; text out; reasoning yes; tool calls yes; JSON mode yes
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-23):** $3.00 / $15.00 per 1M in/out (Sonnet tier)
- **Architecture:** Proprietary

